00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:35.650
I'm sorry, the lead for Donald Trump shrank
from eight to seven, six, five, four, three,

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:36.650
two.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:37.650
Last night, it went below one.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.540
It went to below half a point.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.670
This morning, it was tied.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:49.110
And with the latest addition of votes, Joe
Biden has now taken a lead of about nine thousand

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:54.200
