because of what is left to count.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:03:00.319
Experts in Pennsylvania say there is no path
for Donald Trump to retake that lead.

00:03:00.319 --> 00:03:08.740
In Georgia, Donald Trump has lost his lead,
slowly diminishing from a few points to half

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:16.790
a point to a tie as of right now, statistically
forty nine point four for each candidate.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.620
Although when you go one more digit, you see
that Joe Biden does have a slight lead there

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.680
of about 800 votes.

