00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.549
vote victory.

00:04:21.549 --> 00:04:28.010
As of right now, the popular vote is in Joe
Biden's favor by two point seven percent,

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:34.410
which, because of the very high turnout, is
nearly four million votes, just shy of that

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:41.460
at about two point nine six million votes
right now, just shy of that four three point

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.740
nine six, rather, just shy of a four million
